<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1983] .Net: Continuous query tests fail</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1983</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;See ContinuousQueryAtomiclBackupTest:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;ContinuousQueryAbstractTest.TestFilterBinarizable&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;ContinuousQueryAbstractTest.TestFilterSerializable&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;ContinuousQueryAbstractTest.TestKeepBinary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Logic has changed: now there is a continuous query filter call on each node (primary and backups), instead of a single event on a primary node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
